{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>A lover of feasting</b> — a lover of feasting of food and drink is a man of want. And the meaning: he will lack everything, and this is <b>he who loves wine and oil will not grow rich</b>, that is, he will not amass wealth."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:58.630958759Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}